{"notes":["Security review anvil-cli/sto:local-deploy-coordinator (08557eb) — 5 threat vectors.","THREAT 1 — Activate TOCTOU tamper: FIXED (HIGH→LOW residual). coordinator.go:432 RequireVerified(rel.ArtifactPath) sebelum ExtractArtifact — closes Install→Activate long window (spike e2e HIGH gap). AC1 TestCoordinator_AC1_ActivateTamperedStoredArtifactRejected PASS (flip-byte 5/6+mid checksum FAIL → 'stored artifact verification failed'). Evidence: 6-check VerifyArtifact + RequireVerified di artifact/verification.go:646, safeExtractPath traversal defence. Residual narrow TOCTOU: RequireVerified dan ExtractArtifact buka file terpisah (2x open) — attacker dengan write ke artifacts/ bisa swap dalam ms window. Mitigasi: threshold sudah acceptable (ms vs hours); hardening ideal: verify dari fd yang sama atau copy-then-verify atomic fd.","THREAT 2 — Rollback verify: FIXED (HIGH→MEDIUM residual). rollback.go:171-179 re-verify archived artifact sebelum promote (verification-before-trust), error 'Verification phase'. AC4 TestCoordinator_AC4_RollbackReVerifyArchivedArtifact PASS (tampered archived → rejected, active tetap B). Finding: skip ketika ArtifactPath=='' atau os.IsNotExist — legacy fixture compat. Risk: attacker hapus artifact file → bypass verification → rollback promosi tanpa bukti integritas (stage jadi authority). Rekomendasi: jadikan missing artifact = hard FAIL untuk post-patch releases (cek SavePath existence atau flag verified-at-install), hanya skip untuk synthetic pre-patch paths. Severity MEDIUM, exploit butuh write ke installRoot/artifacts.","THREAT 3 — flock perms: FIXED, PASS LOW. runtime/lock.go:118 O_CREATE|O_RDWR|O_NOFOLLOW 0600 + fstat IsRegular + f.Chmod(0600) self-healing (heals legacy 0644). AC3 TestCoordinator_AC3_Flock0600RegularFileCheck PASS (0600, symlink ELOOP reject, directory 'not a regular file' reject). Kernel flock: cross-process, LOCK_NB fail-fast, crash auto-release (no stale). Reviewed: lock tidak pernah di-unlink (hindari inode swap race), holderSummary baca runtime-state.json tanpa lock (race hanya untuk error message, bukan security). Verdict: controls sesuai TS-015-04-03 \u0026 ADR-014.","THREAT 4 — concurrency race: FIXED PASS. Coordinator Install/Activate/Rollback semua Acquire('install'/'activate'/'rollback') di bawah flock (coordinator.go:147,363,569). Idempotency findReleaseByArtifactID (scan releases .json) dijalankan di dalam lock → no time-of-check race. AC2 8-goroutine Install PASS (exactly 1 success, 0 duplicate JSON, contender 'another lifecycle operation is in progress' atau 'already installed'). Cross-process garansi via runtime/lock_test.go CrossProcessExclusionAndCrashRelease (SIGKILL auto-release). Residual: holderSummary race harmless.","THREAT 5 — supply chain: PARTIAL, MEDIUM. a) Adapter execution: resolveAdapterExecutable LookPath('anvil-adapter-'+framework) dimana framework = reg.Project.StandardName() dari registry YAML (user-controlled). Tidak ada sanitasi framework charset — framework='../../evil' atau 'foo; rm' bisa LookPath ke binary tak terduga (path traversal/shell-meta via framework). Rekomendasi: whitelist ValidateStandardName [a-z0-9_-] + cek tidak mengandung '/' sebelum LookPath. b) Post-activate hook: invokePostActivateHook exec hook di \u003cinstallRoot\u003e/hooks/post-activate jika 0111 executable (coordinator.go:859-886) — attacker dengan write ke installRoot dapat RCE pada next Activate. Mitigasi ada: cek executable bit \u0026 ANVIL_CADDY_RELOAD=0 opt-out, tapi installRoot permissions harus 0750 root:root dan hooks dir tidak world-writable (document \u0026 enforce). c) systemctl reload caddy best-effort via exec.CommandContext timeout 5s — surfaces kecil, no shell. d) Deps: go.mod golang.org/x/crypto v0.54.0 (cek osv-scanner untuk CVE), pin via go.sum. Tidak ada hardcoded secret.","Additional controls reviewed: artifact/verification.go safeExtractPath (abs prefix check, reject absolute/traversal), two-phase extract (validate semua entries dulu baru write), checksum via ComputeChecksum deployable content, immutability check. SymlinkSwitcher atomic rename (same fs). StateStore atomic write (temp+fsync+rename). Tidak ada input validation bypass.","VERDICT: CONDITIONAL APPROVE — HIGH gaps closed (TOCTOU + rollback), flock hardening solid, race idempotent. Merge boleh setelah: (1) rollback missing-artifact jangan skip untuk post-patch real artifacts (MEDIUM fix), (2) sanitasi framework name sebelum LookPath + dokumentasikan installRoot permissions untuk hook (MEDIUM), (3) pertimbangkan narrow TOCTOU fd-pinning sebagai follow-up LOW. Tidak ada blocker HIGH tersisa. Evidence: AC1-AC4 PASS (2.48s), runtime/lock tests PASS, manual code inspection coordinator.go/rollback.go/lock.go/verification.go."],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}